|errata_history=This is errata version PC-E3 (version 4 of 5). It is not the current text. The current text is [[Quietly Observing (V) (Errata 4)]] (PC-E4).
* '''Original''' ([[Quietly Observing (V)]]): Original text. Players Committee card image, no errata mark ([[:File:V11-D-quietlyobserving-original.gif]]; Holotable image set [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/e26d0f1/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/large/quietlyobserving.gif commit e26d0f1 “Images part 1”, 1 August 2019]): “Deploy on table. Aurra, Bossk, and Cad are destiny +2. Once per game, may reveal a unique (•) alien from hand or Reserve Deck (reshuffle); for remainder of game, that card is an assassin and ignores [Reflections II] and [Theed Palace] objective deployment restrictions. [Immune to Alter.]”
* '''PC-E1''' ([[Quietly Observing (V) (Errata)]]): Players Committee card image, no errata mark ([[:File:V11-D-quietlyobserving-20190802.gif]]; Holotable image set [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/60afbbd/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/large/quietlyobserving.gif commit 60afbbd “Using better graphics”, 2 August 2019]): “Deploy on table. Aurra, Bossk, and Cad are destiny +2. Once per game, may reveal a unique (•) alien from hand or Reserve Deck (reshuffle); for remainder of game, that card is an assassin and ignores [Reflections II] and [Theed Palace] objective deployment restrictions. [Immune to Alter.]” '''What changed:''' the card was re-rendered the next day with sharper graphics (crisper text and frame); the words and line breaks are unchanged. Listed as its own version under Bill's ruling of 12 November 2026 (every visible change on a PC image is a version).
* '''PC-E2''' ([[Quietly Observing (V) (Errata 2)]]): Players Committee card image marked “E” ([[:File:V11-D-quietlyobserving-20200512.gif]]; Holotable image set [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/a5142dd/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/large/quietlyobserving.gif commit a5142dd “Tweak set images”, 12 May 2020]): “Deploy on table. Aurra, Bossk, and Cad are destiny +2. Once per game, may reveal up to two unique (•) aliens from hand and/or Reserve Deck (reshuffle); for remainder of game, those cards are assassins and Black Sun agents. [Immune to Alter.]” '''What changed:''' “may reveal a unique (•) alien from hand or Reserve Deck” became “may reveal up to two unique (•) aliens from hand and/or Reserve Deck”; “that card is an assassin and ignores [Reflections II] and [Theed Palace] objective deployment restrictions” became “those cards are assassins and Black Sun agents”.
* '''PC-E3''' (this page): Players Committee card image marked “E1” ([[:File:V11-D-quietlyobserving-20230329.png]]; Holotable image set [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/168657a/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/hires/quietlyobserving.png commit 168657a “Set 11 Remastered”, 29 March 2023]): “Deploy on table. Aurra, Bossk, and Cad are destiny +2. Once per game, may reveal up to two unique (•) aliens from hand and/or Reserve Deck (reshuffle); for remainder of game, those cards are assassins and Black Sun agents. [Immune to Alter.]” '''What changed:''' Set 11 remaster: same words; the errata mark now reads “E1” (was “E”) and the card is re-rendered. Listed as its own version under Bill's ruling of 12 November 2026 (every visible change on a PC image is a version).
* '''PC-E4''' ([[Quietly Observing (V) (Errata 4)]]): Players Committee card image marked “E2” ([[:File:V11-D-quietlyobserving.gif]]; Holotable image set [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/efc26cd/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/hires/quietlyobserving.png commit efc26cd “Set 24 Part 2 (Errata and fixes)”, 29 December 2024]; today's copy [https://res.starwarsccg.org/cards/Virtual11-Dark/large/quietlyobserving.gif res.starwarsccg.org]): “Deploy on table. While alone, assassins are power +1. Once per game, may reveal up to two unique (•) aliens from hand and/or Reserve Deck (reshuffle); for remainder of game, those cards are assassins and, if your [Reflections II] objective on table, Black Sun agents. [Immune to Alter.]” '''What changed:''' “Aurra, Bossk, and Cad are destiny +2” became “While alone, assassins are power +1”; “those cards are assassins and Black Sun agents” became “those cards are assassins and, if your [Reflections II] objective on table, Black Sun agents”.
